      "evidence": "template/scripts/agent_friction.py route_event (~line 1105) catches only RuntimeError. read_operator_config (_platform_common.py:345-350) converts only FileNotFoundError to RuntimeError, so a TOML decode error (ValueError) or PermissionError (OSError) propagates. process_label() now also propagates ValueError/OSError from read_platform_config, and route_event calls it at line 1095. The previous code caught these, and the new tests only exercise RuntimeError paths. A single bad configuration file now aborts route_pending for all events, and no pending route with a reason is stored.",
